    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "2000年年底，东京世田谷，一家四口在家中被杀。",
      "sha256": "fe573fa598af9529aac70165ccbd77199eebab79aaec3073a2cbd697bb8692c7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "现场留下了大量线索，可这起案件，至今没有侦破。",
      "sha256": "26fe87216ee5dd561c52faf8a883053eddea1e30748cafa43d01b6037b1bf7c0",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "父亲宫泽干男44岁，在外资企业做CI开发；学生时代演过话剧，喜欢动画。",
      "sha256": "3d1ced53a90673dfca16d4aeb830ad5397f5445597fa55cad19e48a80ed91833",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "母亲泰子41岁，在家开补习班；女儿妮娜八岁，学芭蕾和钢琴；儿子礼六岁。",
      "sha256": "7e4aef0c0f73aa1c848106ff61d9441f9753dc6f4993a35fbd5bfc649daf7627",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "12月30日傍晚，一家人在千岁乌山买完东西，回家吃饭、看电视。",
      "sha256": "7c7160057a7edc7317d7bf96c35200bd8afc4854a5579b5ca8653f9246db1427",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "那天深夜十一点多，邻居听见一声闷响；之后，那栋房子安静得出奇。",
      "sha256": "323049371aaddaa88bbdfa9f729f4c7974e6095cfaf8e42620de1fbf401f2be2",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 31,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "凶手是从二楼浴室的窗户进去的，离开时，走的是玄关。",
      "sha256": "80f87ed0bda541e29a16aa1f0108f287ea8950789b2e2aaf4a6189ea8fce5464",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 38,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "31日上午，住在隔壁的母亲过来查看，才发现出了事；警方随即赶到。",
      "sha256": "a48303c66f5e647bc77e16a80c27da8adac7a7ecdee41cd6e9ff6090762223e4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 44,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "警方把这里定为重大案件现场，拉起警戒线，开始一寸一寸地勘查。",
      "sha256": "7444305c53234f1f87853785b0622a4aa5dd615fa15aae4048b15a38313f57e8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 51,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "调查人员戴着手套，逐件记录物品的位置：拍照、装袋、编号、封存。",
      "sha256": "b1536b576b2f6b17c87ff2705fc96fa9a5d369d306e1017538458c5bb41ccd7a",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 58,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "一件浅灰身、浅紫袖的拉格伦运动衫，被凶手脱下来，留在现场。",
      "sha256": "76cc649b34ac90f0ac4abf5071ffaa5b22c9fdd5e6976b31ea51267125e0c268",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 65,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "还有两块黑色手帕：其中一块，中间割开三厘米，用来裹住刀柄。",
      "sha256": "2e9b4643a9ffc11b20770609ab6114d824e02522cd3c4f76604869288e321281",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 72,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "刀柄、血迹、指纹，还有吃剩的冰淇淋，证据一件件被送进实验室。",
      "sha256": "05b81bacbef59360cd184a85c0a656a7ec48faedabaddcf6139512b7feeb6437",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 79,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "可证据本身不等于答案；每一件东西，都要和别的线索互相印证。",
      "sha256": "83537b22f470fe9978481d61b2e17bb39aab0a060c0bcd81fa733fcdb8868ad8",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "target_start": 86,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "调查人员发现，案发之后，有人用过这台电脑：上网、建文件夹。",
      "sha256": "859c3120a971b6693da8451abbf6ea7617a22bc663e126b381007a5c0b485d9d",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 93,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "冰箱里的四个冰淇淋被吃掉，厕所被使用过，急救箱也被翻动。",
      "sha256": "b6861b8fc465c3ca31582201a286a3aca8b59b83cb61c3c2dd2de6d9018eae27",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 100,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "现场留下了他的血、他的鞋印，甚至他的指纹，可这个人始终没有名字。",
      "sha256": "8395f8a8ca2363cc6b8170ad6a1c8d93aa3a03b38e64d6ea1267c3a0b393aed9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "target_start": 107,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "二十多年里，警方投入近三十万人次，一遍遍重查物证、翻旧档案。",
      "sha256": "39c1f891c651bc8a5bf031f34b2baefd0a804dbd39843f54b210fd059239ab04",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "找到一件衣服，和证明它是谁的，是两件完全不同的事。",
      "sha256": "c7adaa5406fcc073afe181a399c0cfbfeee6d1fb52af64b99dd78730c0347fa2",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 121,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "时间一年年过去，房子还在，街边的树绿了又黄，答案却一直没有来。",
      "sha256": "a999516ceedc6e31b24f739e9288b8f0c21f2d506ce68c07f80db39e5661760b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "target_start": 128,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "警方从未放弃，一遍遍公开物证，悬赏最高两千万日元，征集线索。",
      "sha256": "588303b90754eae01b47476db5eeceec1370a55c5f6701dbcd041e9353054f04",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "target_start": 135,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "关于凶手是谁、为什么动手，外面猜测很多，可猜测不能当证据。",
      "sha256": "d0e83bab0698256b422ae14972ae0bd4e404879d3fb1f06fabe4dc8919330712",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑男声；语速沉稳、句尾收得轻，像真实犯罪纪录片",
      "narration_id": "N08",
